  "releaseNotes": "Added support for ferries when using the PBFImporter. Its possible to specify which ferries to import, as well as which ferries are allowed to be used in a route calculation by setting appropriate RouteSetting.Vehicle.\n\nThe below code shows how to import Italy and Sicily with the ferries that can take the biggest vehicles:\nFerryOptions ferryOptions = new FerryOptions(FerriesToImport.ForLongerHeavyVehicles, 25, TimeSpan.FromMinutes(20), true);\nPBFImporter.ImportAndSave(tasker, @\"C:\\Dev\\Routing Networks\\OSM\\italy-260712.osm.pbf\", Unit.Kilometer, SpeedUnit.KmPerHour, ferryOptions, @\"C:\\Dev\\Routing Networks\\Networks with landmarks\", \"Italy and Sicily\");",
